<section class="hero"><div class="container hero-inner"><div class="hero-copy reveal"><div class="eyebrow">Expertise you trust. Care you feel.</div><h1>Care that moves.<br>With you, every step<br><span>of the way.</span></h1><p>From everyday wellbeing to specialist care, we bring our expertise together around what matters most. You.</p><div class="hero-buttons"><button class="btn primary" data-book>Find your care <span class="arrow">↗</span></button><a class="text-link" href="#care">Explore our services <span class="arrow">→</span></a></div><div class="hero-proof"><span class="mini-seal"><svg class="icon icon-16"><use href="#i-shield"/></svg></span><span><strong>50 years of care.</strong> A lifetime of trust.</span></div></div><div class="hero-visual reveal"><img class="hero-image" src="~/images/home/hero-doctor.jpg" width="1400" height="1750" alt="A smiling doctor in a white coat in a sunlit outdoor setting" fetchpriority="high"><div class="photo-label"><i></i> THE HUMAN SIDE OF HEALTHCARE</div><div class="care-note"><div class="note-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg></div><div><strong>Expert hands. Caring hearts.</strong><p>Connected care, centred on you.</p></div></div><div class="hero-caption"><span>YOUR HEALTH. OUR SHARED PURPOSE.</span><span class="hero-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></div></div></div></section>
