<section class="section" id="care"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Care for all of you</div><h2>The right care.<br>Right by your side.</h2></div><p>A connected family of healthcare services.<br>One seamless journey, built around you.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.rafflesmedicalgroup.com/services/">View all services <span class="arrow">↗</span></a></div><div class="services-grid"><a class="service-card featured" href="https://www.rafflesmedicalgroup.com/services/family-medicine/"><div class="service-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-steth"/></svg></div><h3>Family Medicine</h3><p>Everyday care for every generation. Close to home, and close to you.</p><span class="card-arrow arrow">↗</span></a><a class="service-card" href="https://www.rafflesmedicalgroup.com/services/specialist-centres/"><div class="service-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg></div><h3>Specialist Care</h3><p>Expertise that comes together. For answers and a way forward.</p><span class="card-arrow arrow">↗</span></a><a class="service-card" href="#screening"><div class="service-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-shield"/></svg></div><h3>Health Screening</h3><p>Get to know your health better. Take the next step with confidence.</p><span class="card-arrow arrow">↗</span></a><a class="service-card" href="https://www.rafflesmedicalgroup.com/services/dental/"><div class="service-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-cross"/></svg></div><h3>Dental Care</h3><p>Healthy smiles, thoughtfully cared for. At every stage of life.</p><span class="card-arrow arrow">↗</span></a></div><p class="services-bottom">Not sure where to start? <button class="text-link btn-plain" data-book>Let us help you find your care <span>→</span></button></p></div></section>
<section class="screening" id="screening"><div class="container screening-layout"><div class="screening-visual"><img src="~/images/home/care-hand.jpg" alt="A reassuring hand held with care and compassion" loading="lazy" width="900" height="600"><div class="image-tag"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-shield"/></svg> PREVENTIVE HEALTH</div></div><div class="screening-copy"><div class="eyebrow">A little foresight. A healthier future.</div><h2>Make room for<br>a healthier tomorrow.</h2><p>Take a proactive approach to your wellbeing with health screening tailored to your needs, supported by a team who sees the whole you.</p><ul class="benefits"><li><span class="check">✓</span> A range of essential and enhanced packages</li><li><span class="check">✓</span> Personalised consultation with your doctor</li><li><span class="check">✓</span> Convenient locations across Singapore</li></ul><a class="btn primary" href="https://www.rafflesmedicalgroup.com/services/health-screening/find-a-package/get-started/">Explore health screening <span class="arrow">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="network" id="locations"><div class="container network-layout"><div class="network-copy"><div class="eyebrow">Connected across Asia</div><h2>Closer to you.<br>Wherever life takes you.</h2><p>From our home in Singapore to our network across Asia, find the Raffles care you know and trust, closer to where you are.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.rafflesmedicalgroup.com/international/medical-clinics-services/">Explore our network <span class="arrow">↗</span></a><div class="country-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Choose a country"><button class="country-tab" id="tab-singapore" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="location-panel" data-country="Singapore">Singapore</button><button class="country-tab" id="tab-china" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="location-panel" tabindex="-1" data-country="China">China</button><button class="country-tab" id="tab-vietnam" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="location-panel" tabindex="-1" data-country="Vietnam">Vietnam</button><button class="country-tab" id="tab-japan" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="location-panel" tabindex="-1" data-country="Japan">Japan</button><button class="country-tab" id="tab-cambodia" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="location-panel" tabindex="-1" data-country="Cambodia">Cambodia</button></div></div><div class="location-card" id="location-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-singapore" tabindex="0"><div class="eyebrow"><svg class="icon icon-15"><use href="#i-pin"/></svg><span id="location-country">Singapore</span></div><h3 id="location-title">Care, in the heart of the city.</h3><p id="location-description">Discover Raffles Hospital and a network of family medicine, dental and specialist clinics across Singapore.</p><div class="location-footer"><span id="location-detail">Hospital · Specialist centres · Clinics</span><a class="text-link" id="location-link" href="https://www.rafflesmedicalgroup.com/clinic/">Find a location <span class="arrow">↗</span></a></div></div></div></section>
